---
import DraftNotice from "../components/DraftNotice.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Terms" description="Terms for using Tessera and this website. Draft.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <DraftNotice updated="2026-10-22" />

    <h2>The software</h2>
    <p>
      Tessera is free software, licensed under the
      <a href="/license/">GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later</a>. That license is what
      governs using, changing and sharing Tessera, and nothing on this page limits the rights it gives you.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      As the license says in sections 15 and 16, Tessera comes with no warranty, and the people who make it
      are not liable for damages from using it, to the extent the law allows. Tessera is in early
      development: keep backups of anything that matters to you.
    </p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      The site describes the project. Its content can change at any time and may describe features that
      are not built yet. Those are marked "planned".
    </p>

    <h2>Hosted services</h2>
    <p>
      Vainnor does not run a hosted sync service today. If one is offered later, it will have its own terms,
      which you will see before you can sign up.
    </p>

    <h2>Names and marks</h2>
    <p>
      The names Tessera and Vainnor and the <span aria-hidden="true">^v█</span><span class="t-visually-hidden">Vainnor</span>
      mark identify this project. <strong>To be decided with legal review:</strong> a trademark policy for
      forks and redistributions.
    </p>

    <h2>Governing law and contact</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>To be decided with legal review.</strong> Questions until then: open a discussion on GitHub.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
